        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T15:47:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I belive the card says whenever a villian TARGET would do damage, not a villian CARD.&nbsp; I don't have it in front of me but I believe that is the case.&nbsp; This is why cards tend to indicate who is attacking&nbsp; (villian with highest HP for example).&nbsp; I don't think any attack comes without a specific target doing the damage.</p>",
