        "created_at": "2013-04-01T17:10:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Some attacks are made by cards rather than targets - Horrid Cacophony, for example.</p><p>But yeah, any time a villain (or, indeed, anything else) makes you hit yourself, it can be pretty nasty if you have damage buffs out (eg Plague Rat's Infections when you're buffed by Galvanise and Inspiring Presence).</p>",
